omesh (14):
  fix: Ledger crash on macOS 26+ (PAC pointer authentication trap)
  feat: all modifications - fast crypto + increased limits + Ledger fix
  feat: add gzip decompression support for RPC responses
  perf: parallel block fetch with 8 connections in
    pull_and_parse_next_blocks
  perf: parallel fast_refresh + hot-block diagnostics + corruption
    recovery
  perf: tune parallel sync — 16 clients, speculative prefetch alignment,
    RAII safety
  grpc-stream: opt-in cmake infrastructure + skeleton client (no logic
    yet)
  grpc-stream: real client implementation + standalone smoke-test binary
  grpc-stream: wallet2 integration — pull_blocks routes through gRPC
    stream when endpoint is set
  grpc-stream: CUPRATE_GRPC_ENDPOINT env var fallback in wallet2::init
  grpc-stream: fix -- use gRPC in background-sync mode + disable
    traditional prefetch when active
  grpc-stream: open stream at m_blockchain.size(), not caller
    start_height
  grpc-stream: detect drift and reopen when stream falls behind wallet +
    pop_wait_ms metric
  Expose mobile gRPC wallet core support

